section: compiler
synopsis:
  Fix a panic when trying to bind a type variable in patterns.
description:
  GHC currently does not allow to bind type variables in patterns. When
  a user would try that, in some situations, we didn't abort eagerly
  enough after discovering the error and thus ran into a panic looking up
  the type in the env while trying to update the local context. Instead,
  when discovering the error,
  we now abort eagerly.
